   "source": [
    "### Q12: Provide an overview of the results that the plant manager can provide the Vice President of Operations. Do they need to completely overhaul line 3 or is it salvagable?"
   ]
  } The results suggest that Line 3 does not need a complete overhaul.
After removing the special-cause subgroups, the process was statistically controlled and capable of meeting specifications. The line appears to be operating well, but the causes of the unusual weeks should be investigated and routine monitoring should continue until the heating element is replaced.
